@@ -39,6 +39,8 @@
 - Align `dc.gsea` and `dc.zscore` with `decoupler` 2.3.1: GSEA permutation p-values are now `(k+1)/(n+1)` and the `KSEA`/`RoKAI` flavors of `zscore` are no longer swapped {pr}`864` {smaller}`S Dicks`
 - Add `min_cells` to {meth}`~rapids_singlecell.ptg.Mixscape.mixscape` for the minimum number of perturbed cells, which `min_de_genes` set before, matching pertpy and Seurat {pr}`873` {smaller}`L Heumos`
 - Fix `dc.waggr` p-values: they are now two-sided empirical p-values `(k+1)/(n+1)` that count the observed score as one permutation, so they are never 0 {pr}`855` {smaller}`S Dicks`
+- Fix `dc.waggr` with `seed=0`, which left the permutations unshuffled; it now shuffles as `decoupler` 2.3 does {pr}`889` {smaller}`S Dicks`
+- Fix the IVF-PQ neighbor searches (`ivfpq`, `mg_ivfpq`, and `all_neighbors` with `algo="ivf_pq"`) on fewer than 512 cells with cuVS 26.12, which no longer builds indexes that small; they are now searched exactly {pr}`889` {smaller}`S Dicks`
 
 ```{rubric} Misc
 ```
